<title>USA: TABLE-Status Computer Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Status Computer Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MARLBORO, Mass. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Statements of Income</p>
<p>(in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>			     Second Quarter Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>				  6/29/97   6/30/96  6/29/97  6/30/96</p>
<p>  Total revenues	     167,572  140,301  323,237  283,226</p>
<p>Restructuring charge</p>
<p>  (a)				  ---    4,623	---    4,623</p>
<p> Net income		     17,401    4,455   32,179   15,038</p>
<p>Weighted average shares of common</p>
<p>stock and common stock equivalents</p>
<p>  outstanding		   24,356   23,758   24,182   23,671</p>
<p>Net income per common</p>
<p>  share			     0.71     0.19     1.33     0.64</p>
<p>NOTE(a): The results of operations for the 1996 second quarter and first six months include a one-time charge of $4.6 million for the cost of restructuring the company's software business.  Excluding this charge, earnings per share for the second quarter and first six months of 1996 would have been $0.34 and $0.79, respectively.</p>
<p>Stratus Computer Inc.</p>
